## Quality Gate

**PASS.**
- Final coord_list is 268/268 identical to original (full-res) output
- Face landmarks from DWPose are unchanged (same model, same input, same resolution)
- S3FD bbox differences (max 17px) never affect output because DWPose always
  produces valid landmarks for this avatar video

