   `s3fd_scale` (default 0.5x)

## Notes

- **Coord caching already exists**: `--use_saved_coord` skips the entire face
  detection phase on subsequent sessions. This optimization only affects the
  first-run cold start per avatar video.
- **DWPose backbone batching is proven fast** (0.9ms/frame at batch=16) but
  blocked by mmpose API overhead. A custom model wrapper bypassing `test_step`
  could unlock another ~3x, but requires reimplementing affine coordinate decode.
